        <mxCell id="ctitle" value="wegofwd-arivu — the corpus, conceptually  (rights-cleared data in ▸ cited passages out; no personal data)" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
